`},{slug:"africa-fastest-growing-esports-market",title:"Why Africa Could Become the Fastest-Growing Esports Market",category:"blog",excerpt:"Exploring the demographic and technological forces driving esports growth across Africa.",date:"2026-01-14",readTime:"5 min read",coverImage:"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511512578047-dfb367046420?q=80&w=2071&auto=format&fit=crop",author:"Gamr Editorial",tags:["esports","africa","market growth"],trendingScore:26,content:`
